---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { buildBreadcrumbSchema } from '../utils/schema';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { name: 'Home', url: site.url + '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: site.url + '/privacy-policy/' },
];

const schema = buildBreadcrumbSchema(breadcrumbItems);
const lastUpdated = '2025-01-01';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | pharmajobsupport.com"
  description="Privacy policy for pharmajobsupport.com — how we collect, use, and protect personal information provided by visitors and clients."
  schema={schema}
>
  <div class="policy-container">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <header class="policy-hero">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="policy-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated} &middot; pharmajobsupport.com</p>
    </header>

    <div class="policy-body">

      <section>
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          PharmaCDM ("we", "us", "our") operates pharmajobsupport.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect personal information when you visit our website or engage with our services.
        </p>
        <p>
          By using this website, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
        <p>When you contact us via WhatsApp, email, or any contact form, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name and professional title</li>
          <li>Email address and phone number</li>
          <li>Job role, employer, and domain information relevant to your support request</li>
          <li>Content of your inquiry or support request</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <p>When you visit pharmajobsupport.com, standard web server logs and analytics may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP address (anonymised where possible)</li>
          <li>Browser type and version</li>
          <li>Pages visited and time on site</li>
          <li>Referral source</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We use privacy-respecting analytics tools. We do not deploy Google Analytics tracking pixels or invasive third-party advertising trackers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide the services you have requested</li>
          <li>Match you with an appropriate domain specialist</li>
          <li>Coordinate support sessions and follow-ups</li>
          <li>Improve our website content and service offerings</li>
          <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes. We do not contact your employer or any third party related to your professional engagement without your explicit written consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Confidentiality of Support Sessions</h2>
        <p>
          All client support sessions are subject to strict confidentiality. We do not retain records of support session content beyond the immediate delivery of services. We do not share details of any client engagement with any employer, recruiter, agency, or regulatory body.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our specialists sign non-disclosure agreements covering all client information. Session content — including tasks, deliverables, employer names, and job role information — is treated as strictly confidential.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain contact information (name, email, WhatsApp number) for as long as you remain an active client or enquirer. If you request deletion of your data, we will remove it within 30 days, subject to any legal retention requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          Session content is not retained beyond the completion of the support engagement. Communication records via WhatsApp are governed by WhatsApp's data retention policies, which are outside our control once messages are delivered.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          pharmajobsupport.com is a static website. We use minimal or no cookies beyond those required for basic site functionality. We do not use advertising cookies, retargeting pixels, or cross-site tracking technologies.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you reach our site via third-party platforms (WhatsApp, LinkedIn, Google), those platforms may set their own cookies subject to their respective privacy policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services (WhatsApp, LinkedIn). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party services you access from our site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal information from unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. Our website is delivered over HTTPS. WhatsApp communications use end-to-end encryption by default.
        </p>
        <p>
          No method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your information, we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Correct inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your personal data</li>
          <li>Object to or restrict processing of your data</li>
          <li>Data portability (where applicable)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or via WhatsApp at {site.whatsapp}.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our services are directed at adult pharmaceutical professionals. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 18 years of age. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please contact us for immediate deletion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your personal information:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
          <li>WhatsApp: <a href={site.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{site.whatsapp}</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href={site.url}>{site.url}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-container {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 5% var(--space-14);
  }
  .policy-hero {
    padding: var(--space-10) 0 var(--space-6);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }
  .policy-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .policy-meta { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-muted); }

  .policy-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8); }
  .policy-body section h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .policy-body section h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2); color: var(--color-text); }
  .policy-body p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .policy-body p + p { margin-top: var(--space-3); }
  .policy-body ul {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
  .policy-body li { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .policy-body a { color: var(--color-primary); }
</style>
